# Sysmon Monitoring

## Objective

Deploy Sysmon to improve endpoint visibility and gain experience analyzing security-relevant Windows events generated during offensive security testing.

## Environment

### Monitoring Host

* Windows 10 Pro
* Domain Joined Workstation
* Active Directory Environment

### Security Tools

* Sysmon
* Event Viewer
* Kali Linux
* Chainsaw

## Overview

Sysmon provides detailed endpoint telemetry that is not available through standard Windows logging alone.

The goal of this project was to capture and analyze activity generated by common attacker techniques in a controlled lab environment.

## Sysmon Deployment

Installed Sysmon on the Windows workstation and verified successful operation.

Verified:

* Sysmon Service Running
* Event Collection Active
* Logs Available in Event Viewer

